  },
  {
    "kind": "table",
    "text": "Table 1: Retrieval quality on the test set.\n| Method | Recall@10 | MRR@10 | nDCG@10 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| BM25 | 0.712 | 0.534 | 0.581 |\n| Dense | 0.768 | 0.571 | 0.619 |\n| Hybrid (RRF) | 0.823 | 0.602 | 0.660 |",
    "level": 0,
